| **2** | Smooth parts of \(N^2-1\) + enumeration of CRT roots + Coppersmith | Deterministic \(N^{0.15+o(1)}\) or better for suitable common divisors of \(p^2-1,q^2-1\); an unconditional infinite family with exponent \(2/13+\varepsilon\) | **PROVED deduction below**, with explicit structural promises | **70%** |
| **3** | Genus-two order distribution + Younis’s short-interval theorem | Under RH, target \(L_p[1/2,2+o(1)]\), hence \(L_N[1/2,2/\sqrt5+o(1)]\) when \(p\asymp N^{1/5}\) | **SPECULATIVE corollary**: analytic input available under RH; full LPP accounting needs auditing | **55% conditional; <2% unconditional** |
| **4** | Two-stage \(p-1\) + a second-largest-prime sieve minorant + Fouvry separation | Positive proportion of near-balanced semiprimes at \(N^{0.150+\varepsilon}\) | **SPECULATIVE** positive-density semismooth-shift lemma | **20%** |
| **5** | Explicit ECM family + second-moment separation + the repository’s fourth-moment fallback | Deterministic almost-all and complete average cost \(N^{23/152+o(1)}\approx N^{0.151316}\) | **PROVED conditional calculation**; curve-family moment bound **SPECULATIVE** | **5%** for the factoring improvement |
